169
00:18:39.862 --> 00:18:41.175
Question 10.

170
00:18:41.125 --> 00:18:44.575
What did the Red Stocking movement work for, among other things?

171
00:18:44.575 --> 00:18:48.025
Option A: Equality between men and women.

172
