176
00:19:09.202 --> 00:19:10.677
Question 11.

177
00:19:10.627 --> 00:19:14.052
Which political movement was the Red Stocking movement part of?

178
00:19:14.052 --> 00:19:17.940
Option A: The labour movement of the 1930s.

179
00:19:17.940 --> 00:19:22.015
Option B: The women's movement of the 1970s.

180
00:19:22.015 --> 00:19:26.118
Option C: The environmental movement of the 1990s.
